# P1 stable evidence (b): unresolved compact head is NOT a call merely from
# parentheses. c.bogus is is_known (passes the early unsupported-body gate) but
# is not a method; without the COMPACT short-circuit, head_is_call is 0 and the
# statement reaches the non-call check_fields route, which refuses an empty body.
fn: main () int
    c.bogus()
    return: 0
end: main
